{"case_id": "male_19710412_P005-Q23", "domain": "career", "question": "命主工作收入平均如何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主丁火生于辰月，土旺火相，但辰为湿土，火气不显。年柱辛亥，金水相生，月柱壬辰，水势较强，日支卯木生火，时柱戊申，土金相生。整体来看，丁火偏弱，喜木火帮扶，忌金水。\n\n命局中财星（金）透于年时，但日主身弱，难以担财，且月干壬水正官克身，压力较大。时柱戊土伤官生财，但申金为财星，被卯木暗合，财有被合走之象，收入虽有机会但不易聚财。大运方面，若行木火运则可得财，但原局水旺，中年后运走北方水地，财星受制，收入水平中等偏上，但难达高收入。\n\n综合判断，命主收入应能超过50万新台币，但未达100万级别，属于中等偏上水平。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19710412_P005-Q23", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r2\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_0_g2\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3509, "response_id": "ff8e574b-38ad-46bd-a128-e013982454d7", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 225, "completion_tokens": 232, "total_tokens": 457, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 97}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
